{"title":"Grabbit","slug":"Grabbit","pageid":4968,"revid":21660,"timestamp":"2026-05-23T16:31:01Z","lastEditor":"Ludicolocynth","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Hop 'N' Shop"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v.1.80.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"history","text":"History"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Grabbit</b> looks like a hybrid of a rabbit and a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/GrUdge/\">GrUdge</a>. It can be obtained from the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Bag_of_Scrambled_Mystery/\">Bag of Scrambled Mystery</a> with a 1 in 777 chance (0.129%).\n</p><p>If you have a <b>Grabbit</b>, please replace the placeholder with a picture of it.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"history\">History</h2>\n<ul><li>Was added on the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>;</li></ul>\n\n</div>"}
